 "captions": [
  {
   "start": 0.5,
   "end": 4.378,
   "text": "Quotes scattered across e-mail. Comparisons in spreadsheets."
  },
  {
   "start": 4.418,
   "end": 7.708,
   "text": "Decisions nobody can explain. And payment on trust."
  },
  {
   "start": 8.148,
   "end": 11.65,
   "text": "VeilProcure turns that into one confidential workflow,"
  },
  {
   "start": 11.69,
   "end": 12.175,
   "text": "on NEAR."
  },
  {
   "start": 12.7,
   "end": 16.074,
   "text": "Picture a small studio hiring an accessibility auditor."
  },
  {
   "start": 16.514,
   "end": 18.733,
   "text": "It wants competing quotes kept apart,"
  },
  {
   "start": 18.773,
   "end": 22.396,
   "text": "rules everyone sees up front, and payment only when the work"
  },
  {
   "start": 22.436,
   "end": 23.19,
   "text": "is delivered."
  },
  {
   "start": 23.63,
   "end": 26.875,
   "text": "Here is that whole journey, recorded live on NEAR testnet."
  },
  {
   "start": 27.3,
   "end": 29.498,
   "text": "Sign in with a one-time e-mail link,"
  },
  {
   "start": 29.538,
   "end": 33.104,
   "text": "create your organisation, and bind your NEAR wallet with a"
  },
  {
   "start": 33.144,
   "end": 34.036,
   "text": "signed message."
  },
  {
   "start": 35.4,
   "end": 38.932,
   "text": "VeilProcure never holds your keys: every on-chain step is"
  },
  {
   "start": 38.972,
   "end": 39.809,
   "text": "signed by you."
  },
  {
   "start": 40.9,
   "end": 43.568,
   "text": "Describe the work, the deliverables and the budget."
  },
  {
   "start": 45.3,
   "end": 47.679,
   "text": "Set hard requirements every quote must pass,"
  },
  {
   "start": 47.719,
   "end": 49.604,
   "text": "and the weights that rank the rest."
  },
  {
   "start": 50.5,
   "end": 52.754,
   "text": "Invite suppliers, and set a deadline."
  },
  {
   "start": 53.1,
   "end": 56.974,
   "text": "Publishing freezes these rules and anchors their hash on NEAR"
  },
  {
   "start": 57.014,
   "end": 60.31,
   "text": "testnet, so the criteria can't quietly change later."
  },
  {
   "start": 60.8,
   "end": 64.637,
   "text": "Each supplier gets a private invitation that only their e-mail"
  },
  {
   "start": 64.677,
   "end": 65.325,
   "text": "can accept."
  },
  {
   "start": 65.7,
   "end": 68.206,
   "text": "They quote price, delivery and approach,"
  },
  {
   "start": 68.246,
   "end": 70.497,
   "text": "attach a proposal, and seal the bid:"
  },
  {
   "start": 70.537,
   "end": 73.998,
   "text": "a salted fingerprint of the quote is recorded on chain."
  },
  {
   "start": 75.9,
   "end": 78.493,
   "text": "Until the deadline, the buyer sees nothing,"
  },
  {
   "start": 78.533,
   "end": 81.187,
   "text": "and competitors can't even open the request."
  },
  {
   "start": 81.9,
   "end": 85.058,
   "text": "After the chain-time deadline, the buyer closes bidding."
  },
  {
   "start": 87.1,
   "end": 90.305,
   "text": "Every opened quote is recomputed against its fingerprint,"
  },
  {
   "start": 90.345,
   "end": 92.923,
   "text": "so any change since sealing would be detected."
  },
  {
   "start": 93.5,
   "end": 95.643,
   "text": "That proves integrity, not secrecy:"
  },
  {
   "start": 95.683,
   "end": 99.449,
   "text": "quotes are encrypted at rest, and the platform holds the key."
  },
  {
   "start": 100.1,
   "end": 103.59,
   "text": "First, the published rules: ineligible quotes are flagged,"
  },
  {
   "start": 103.63,
   "end": 106.268,
   "text": "and eligible ones are ranked by the weights."
  },
  {
   "start": 106.7,
   "end": 109.689,
   "text": "Then, if you ask, a private AI reviews the quotes."
  },
  {
   "start": 109.9,
   "end": 113.699,
   "text": "Nothing is sent until the model's hardware attestation is"
  },
  {
   "start": 113.739,
   "end": 117.606,
   "text": "verified through NEAR AI Cloud, and the signed response is"
  },
  {
   "start": 117.646,
   "end": 118.818,
   "text": "checked on return."
  },
  {
   "start": 120.5,
   "end": 124.574,
   "text": "The notes are advisory: the AI cannot award or move money."
  },
  {
   "start": 125.1,
   "end": 128.829,
   "text": "The buyer awards the top quote and funds the escrow with"
  },
  {
   "start": 128.869,
   "end": 131.387,
   "text": "exactly that amount: 1.2 testnet NEAR,"
  },
  {
   "start": 131.427,
   "end": 132.868,
   "text": "from their own wallet."
  },
  {
   "start": 135.7,
   "end": 139.377,
   "text": "The contract now holds the funds. It can only pay the awarded"
  },
  {
   "start": 139.417,
   "end": 141.692,
   "text": "supplier, or return them to the buyer."
  },
  {
   "start": 144.3,
   "end": 147.578,
   "text": "The supplier accepts, delivers, and anchors evidence of the"
  },
  {
   "start": 147.618,
   "end": 147.859,
   "text": "work."
  },
  {
   "start": 153.1,
   "end": 156.642,
   "text": "The buyer approves, and the contract pays the supplier:"
  },
  {
   "start": 156.682,
   "end": 160.093,
   "text": "a real transaction anyone can verify on NEAR testnet."
  },
  {
   "start": 162.1,
   "end": 164.94,
   "text": "A release by anyone else, or a second payout,"
  },
  {
   "start": 164.98,
   "end": 167.18,
   "text": "is rejected by the contract itself."
  },
  {
   "start": 167.5,
   "end": 170.261,
   "text": "And every step lands in a hash-chained audit trail."
  },
  {
   "start": 172.3,
   "end": 175.582,
   "text": "VeilProcure. Private bids. Intelligent decisions."
  },
  {
   "start": 175.622,
   "end": 177.481,
   "text": "Payments under your control."
  }
 ],
